@chapter Costs
@cindex costs
@findex gascity-costs
@kindex j $

@kbd{j $} (or @kbd{M-x gascity-costs}) shows @command{gc costs} ---
model tokens and compute wall-seconds recorded per run, with a
list-price estimate --- in a read-only buffer,
@file{*gascity-costs:@: CITY*}.  @command{gc} prints it as a text table
and has no JSON form of it, so the text is shown exactly as @command{gc}
